'''Silver Logchopper''' is a [[Unique Weapons|unique]] [[:Category:Knives|knife]] that was awarded to the player who finished '''2nd''' on the [[Christmas Event 2019|Christmas 2019]] '''Coin-Collecting''' Leaderboard.

== Appearance ==
The Silver Logchopper has the same appearance as [[Logchopper]], but replacing its primary colors with a white silver coloring.

==Trivia==
*During the [[Christmas Event 2019|2019 Christmas Event]], there were 2 different leaderboards; '''Tokens-Collected''' and '''Gifts-Given'''.
*In order to obtain this item, participants needed to collect as many '''[[Snow Tokens|Winter Tokens]]''' (act exactly like [[coins]]) as possible in order to score points. Points determined their rank in the leaderboard.
*Other variants of this include [[Blue Logchopper|Blue LogChopper]], [[Bronze Logchopper|Bronze LogChopper]], and [[Gold Logchopper]].
*This item is a silver reskin of [[Logchopper|LogChopper]], an [[Ancient Weapons|ancient]] knife.
*This item used to emit silver sparkles. However, this feature was removed in July of 2022 for an unknown reason.
*This item is [[Trading|untradable]].
*The sole owner of this knife is '''[https://www.roblox.com/users/223771938/profile Chris Patron]'''.


